0.20 & 0.52 (medium) & 1.15\; $[0.66,\; 1.26]$ & 0.55 (medium) & 0.21\; $[0.07,\; 0.40]$ \\ % exp_id: bf16_ds_imp_s020, bf16_qw_imp_s020; per-problem paired B=10000; d_z from cohens_d_bf16.json
